    {
      "id": "scene3",
      "name": { "en": "Walking Tour", "fi": "Kävelykierros" },
      "activateInteractionOutlines": true,
      "audio": {
        "url": "audio/Scene_3.mp3",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "loop": false,
        "autoplay": true,
        "delay": 1000,
        "positional": true,
        "position": [4, -3.5, 20.1],
        "refDistance": 15,
        "maxDistance": 50,
        "waypoints": [
          {"time": 5, "position": [26, -15.0, 19]},
          {"time": 25, "position": [26, -15.0, 25]},
          {"time": 46, "position": [24, -19.0, 51]},
          {"time": 56, "position": [14, -17.0, 51]},
          {"time": 81, "position": [-12, -13.0, 51]},
          {"time": 108, "position": [-11, -14.0, 40]},
          {"time": 116, "position": [-17, -11.0, 47]},
          {"time": 127, "position": [15, -14.0, -7.5]},
          {"time": 166, "position": [-9, -23.0, 25.5]},
          {"time": 179, "position": [27.5, -5.0, 39]},
          {"time": 192, "position": [27, -4, 28]}
        ]
      },
      "subtitles": {
        "en": [
          {"start": 1, "end": 5, "text": "The first things we need when we arrive at the stabilisation point"},
          {"start": 5, "end": 10, "text": "are gloves and scissors for immediately"},
          {"start": 10, "end": 13, "text": "cutting the patients' clothing"},
          {"start": 13, "end": 15, "text": "in order to examine"},
          {"start": 15, "end": 19, "text": "the injuries they have sustained."},
          {"start": 22, "end": 26, "text": "Here we have items for wound treatment:"},
          {"start": 26, "end": 31, "text": "wipes and bandages"},
          {"start": 31, "end": 36, "text": "to treat wounds as much as possible,"},
          {"start": 36, "end": 40, "text": "hemostatic dressings, bandages, and occlusive patches."},
          {"start": 40, "end": 42, "text": "And clothing,"},
          {"start": 42, "end": 47, "text": "which is essential because we cut off all the clothing from the men,"},
          {"start": 47, "end": 51, "text": "and we need to give them something to wear."},
          {"start": 51, "end": 53, "text": "All the equipment here is for resuscitating."},
          {"start": 53, "end": 59, "text": "We have many medications, and this device here is a defibrillator."},
          {"start": 59, "end": 69, "text": "We need it a lot for inserting central venous catheters, intubation tubes, and more."},
          {"start": 69, "end": 75, "text": "These are all the medications we use during resuscitation."},
          {"start": 75, "end": 78, "text": "Here, we have adrenaline."},
          {"start": 78, "end": 80, "text": "This section is for pain relief,"},
          {"start": 80, "end": 84, "text": "for administering anesthesia in case the patient has any fractures."},
          {"start": 84, "end": 87, "text": "This is everything we need for first aid."},
          {"start": 87, "end": 91, "text": "We have all the medications required for treating wounds:"},
          {"start": 91, "end": 95, "text": "various medication, catheters, infusion systems and fluids for infusion."},
          {"start": 95, "end": 100, "text": "Painkillers, hemostatics, antibiotics,"},
          {"start": 100, "end": 105, "text": "everything we might need at this stage, is available."},
          {"start": 105, "end": 108, "text": "This is section four:"},
          {"start": 108, "end": 112, "text": "a device for warming infusion fluids."},
          {"start": 112, "end": 118, "text": "These are my little treasures, my motankas. I always have them with me."},
          {"start": 118, "end": 123, "text": "They also move with us. They came from the previous stabilisation point,"},
          {"start": 123, "end": 125, "text": "along with our flag."},
          {"start": 125, "end": 127, "text": "Here, of course, is the surgical table,"},
          {"start": 127, "end": 135, "text": "where we have instruments, sutures, and scalpels for removing fragments."},
          {"start": 135, "end": 142, "text": "If there are any fragments, if we can, we remove them."},
          {"start": 142, "end": 147, "text": "If the fragment isn't too deep, the doctor will remove it here."},
          {"start": 147, "end": 152, "text": "Our most important tools are magnets"},
          {"start": 152, "end": 159, "text": "that we use to detect or extract fragments from wounds."},
          {"start": 159, "end": 163, "text": "We have different types of magnets."},
          {"start": 163, "end": 167, "text": "We can't do without a heater here."},
          {"start": 167, "end": 169, "text": "The patients get cold, because we undress them,"},
          {"start": 169, "end": 174, "text": "So whenever we have electricity,"},
          {"start": 174, "end": 177, "text": "we turn the heater on to keep the room warm."},
          {"start": 177, "end": 179, "text": "This icon of the Virgin Mary"},
          {"start": 179, "end": 182, "text": "always moves with us,"},
          {"start": 182, "end": 184, "text": "and so does our clock."},
          {"start": 184, "end": 189, "text": "These stickers also go everywhere with us."},
          {"start": 189, "end": 192, "text": "We need the clock for our work here,"},
          {"start": 192, "end": 198, "text": "because during resuscitation, we need to know"},
          {"start": 198, "end": 201, "text": "the exact time we started"},
          {"start": 201, "end": 205, "text": "and the intervals for administering specific medications."},
          {"start": 205, "end": 207, "text": "That's why we need the clock."},
          {"start": 211, "end": 214, "text": "There was absolutely nothing here,"},
          {"start": 214, "end": 217, "text": "not even electricity or water."},
          {"start": 217, "end": 222, "text": "We set up everything ourselves"},
          {"start": 222, "end": 225, "text": "and organised it all, to help the wounded."},
          {"start": 227, "end": 231, "text": "To tell you the truth, I felt like crying."},
          {"start": 231, "end": 235, "text": "There was a big hole in the wall. You could see right through it."},
          {"start": 235, "end": 240, "text": "And from here, you could see the sunlight outside through the hole."},
          {"start": 240, "end": 245, "text": "We covered it up with whatever we had, patched it a bit,"},
          {"start": 245, "end": 249, "text": "just to stop the wind from blowing through,"},
          {"start": 249, "end": 253, "text": "at least. Let's just say that."},
          {"start": 253, "end": 256, "text": "Right now, we have no electricity. We're relying on a generator,"},
          {"start": 256, "end": 260, "text": "Even though it's cold, we can't heat the space,"},
          {"start": 260, "end": 263, "text": "because the generator can't handle such high voltage."},
          {"start": 263, "end": 265, "text": "The poor lads have to be undressed when they are brought here,"},
          {"start": 265, "end": 267, "text": "even though it's so cold."},
          {"start": 267, "end": 270, "text": "Small issues like that can pile up"},
          {"start": 270, "end": 276, "text": "and lead to more serious problems later on."},
          {"start": 276, "end": 280, "text": "We have to move very often for safety reasons."},
          {"start": 280, "end": 286, "text": "When the front line moves, we also have to move with it."},
          {"start": 286, "end": 290, "text": "We have already moved twice."},
          {"start": 290, "end": 294, "text": "Where we were wasn't safe. There were too many strikes."},
          {"start": 294, "end": 300, "text": "The Russians even destroyed a church."},
          {"start": 302, "end": 305, "text": "Nothing is sacred to them."}
        ],
        "fi": [
          {"start": 1, "end": 5, "text": "Ensimmäiset asiat, joita ensihoitopisteellä tarvitsemme, -"},
          {"start": 5, "end": 7, "text": "ovat kumihanskat ja sakset."},
          {"start": 8, "end": 13, "text": "Niiden avulla saamme potilailta leikattua vaatteet pois, -"},
          {"start": 13, "end": 15, "text": "jotta näemme, -"},
          {"start": 15, "end": 19, "text": "mitä heille on tapahtunut eli mitä vammoja heillä on."},
          {"start": 22, "end": 26, "text": "Tässä on tarvikkeita haavanhoitoon, -"},
          {"start": 26, "end": 31, "text": "paperipyyhkeitä ja sideharsoa."},
          {"start": 31, "end": 36, "text": "Niiden avulla voimme hoitaa haavoja mahdollisimman hyvin -"},
          {"start": 36, "end": 40, "text": "ja tehdä erilaisia taitoksia, kääreitä ja sulkusidoksia."},
          {"start": 40, "end": 42, "text": "Ja vaatteita."},
          {"start": 42, "end": 47, "text": "Niitä tarvitaan, sillä leikkaamme potilailta vaatteet pois."},
          {"start": 47, "end": 51, "text": "Meidän täytyy siis pukea heidät."},
          {"start": 51, "end": 53, "text": "Täällä on kaikkea, mitä tarvitaan elvyttämiseen."},
          {"start": 53, "end": 59, "text": "Tämä laite on defibrillaattori."},
          {"start": 59, "end": 61, "text": "Näitä käytetään -"},
          {"start": 61, "end": 69, "text": "keskuslaskimokatetrien ja intubaatioputkien asettamiseen."},
          {"start": 69, "end": 75, "text": "Tässä on lääkkeitä, joita käytetään elvyttämiseen."},
          {"start": 75, "end": 78, "text": "Tässä on adrenaliinia."},
          {"start": 78, "end": 80, "text": "Tässä on kipulääkkeitä."},
          {"start": 80, "end": 84, "text": "Näitä annetaan, jos jotain on murtunut ja potilas pitää nukuttaa."},
          {"start": 84, "end": 87, "text": "Nämä ovat ensiapua varten."},
          {"start": 87, "end": 91, "text": "Täällä on kaikkea, mitä tarvitaan, jos joku on haavoittunut."},
          {"start": 91, "end": 95, "text": "Täällä on erilaisia lääkkeitä, katetreja ja infuusionesteitä, -"},
          {"start": 95, "end": 100, "text": "kipulääkkeitä, hemostaatteja ja antibiootteja."},
          {"start": 100, "end": 105, "text": "Meillä on kaikkea, mitä tässä vaiheessa tarvitaan."},
          {"start": 105, "end": 108, "text": "Neljäs ryhmä on laite, -"},
          {"start": 108, "end": 112, "text": "jolla voi lämmittää infuusionestettä."},
          {"start": 112, "end": 118, "text": "Nämä ovat minun nukkeni. Ne ovat aina mukanani."},
          {"start": 118, "end": 123, "text": "Ne muuttavat mukanamme paikasta toiseen."},
          {"start": 123, "end": 125, "text": "Tässä on lippumme."},
          {"start": 125, "end": 127, "text": "Ja tietysti kirurginpöytä."},
          {"start": 127, "end": 131, "text": "Tässä on eri instrumentteja, -"},
          {"start": 131, "end": 135, "text": "välineitä haavojen ompeluun ja skalpelleja."},
          {"start": 137, "end": 139, "text": "Jos vain pystymme, -"},
          {"start": 139, "end": 144, "text": "poistamme jo täällä kehosta mahdolliset sirpaleet."},
          {"start": 144, "end": 147, "text": "Jos sirpale ei ole syvällä, lääkäri poistaa sen."},
          {"start": 147, "end": 152, "text": "Tärkeimpiä työvälineitä ovat magneetit."},
          {"start": 152, "end": 159, "text": "Niiden avulla voimme etsiä ja poistaa sirpaleita haavoista."},
          {"start": 159, "end": 163, "text": "Meillä on erilaisia magneetteja."},
          {"start": 163, "end": 167, "text": "Ilman lämmitintä täällä ei pärjää."},
          {"start": 167, "end": 169, "text": "Potilailla on kylmä, mehän riisumme heidät."},
          {"start": 169, "end": 174, "text": "Joten aina, kun meillä on sähköä, -"},
          {"start": 174, "end": 177, "text": "pidämme lämmitintä päällä."},
          {"start": 177, "end": 179, "text": "Jumalansynnyttäjän ikoni."},
          {"start": 179, "end": 182, "text": "Sekin muuttaa aina mukanamme."},
          {"start": 182, "end": 184, "text": "Kello ja kaikki tarramme."},
          {"start": 184, "end": 189, "text": "Nekin matkustavat mukanamme."},
          {"start": 189, "end": 192, "text": "Työssämme tarvitaan myös kelloa, -"},
          {"start": 192, "end": 198, "text": "sillä kun elvytämme, meidän täytyy tietää,"},
          {"start": 198, "end": 201, "text": "moneltako aloitimme -"},
          {"start": 201, "end": 205, "text": "ja mihin aikaan mitäkin lääkettä annetaan."},
          {"start": 205, "end": 207, "text": "Tähänkin tarvitaan kelloa."},
          {"start": 211, "end": 214, "text": "Täällä ei ollut yhtään mitään, -"},
          {"start": 214, "end": 217, "text": "ei edes sähköä eikä vettä."},
          {"start": 217, "end": 222, "text": "Järjestimme kaiken itse -"},
          {"start": 222, "end": 225, "text": "voidaksemme auttaa haavoittuneita."},
          {"start": 227, "end": 231, "text": "Jos ihan suoraan sanon, niin minun teki mieli itkeä."},
          {"start": 231, "end": 235, "text": "Seinässä oli kämmenenmentävä aukko."},
          {"start": 235, "end": 240, "text": "Seinän läpi näki päivänvalon."},
          {"start": 240, "end": 245, "text": "Olemme saaneet paikkoja jotenkuten korjattua, peitettyä ja teipattua."},
          {"start": 245, "end": 249, "text": "Jotta tänne ei ainakaan tuulisi sisälle, -"},
          {"start": 249, "end": 253, "text": "sanotaan nyt vaikka niin."},
          {"start": 253, "end": 256, "text": "Nyt ei ole sähköä ja olemme generaattorin varassa."},
          {"start": 256, "end": 260, "text": "Vaikka on kylmä, emme voi lämmittää, -"},
          {"start": 260, "end": 263, "text": "koska generaattori ei kestä niin isoa jännitettä."},
          {"start": 263, "end": 265, "text": "Poikaraukat pitää riisua, kun heidät tuodaan tänne, -"},
          {"start": 265, "end": 267, "text": "vaikka täällä on kylmä."},
          {"start": 267, "end": 270, "text": "Pienet ongelmat voivat kasaantua -"},
          {"start": 270, "end": 276, "text": "ja johtaa ajan myötä suurempiin vaikeuksiin."},
          {"start": 276, "end": 280, "text": "Turvallisuussyistä joudumme vaihtamaan usein paikkaa."},
          {"start": 280, "end": 286, "text": "Kun rintamalinja siirtyy, meidän on vaihdettava paikkaa sen mukana."},
          {"start": 286, "end": 290, "text": "Olemme siirtyneet jo kahdesti."},
          {"start": 290, "end": 294, "text": "Aiemmassa paikassa ei ollut turvallista."},
          {"start": 294, "end": 300, "text": "Venäläiset tuhosivat jopa kirkon."},
          {"start": 302, "end": 305, "text": "Heille mikään ei ole pyhää."}
        ]
      },
